1302:
The following uses are permitted in historical (H) districts:
a. Any use permitted in an R-1 residential district;
b. Bed and breakfast inns;
c. Restaurants;
d. Gift shops (all merchandise must be displayed indoors except on occasions when a sidewalk sale permit is obtained);
e. Antique shops (all merchandise must be displayed indoors except on occasions when a sidewalk sale permit is obtained);
f. Furniture import shops (all merchandise must be displayed indoors except on occasions when a sidewalk sale permit is obtained);
g. Physicians, lawyers, engineers, architects, accountants and similar professional uses, excluding veterinarians.
(Ord. No. 360, § III, 10-6-98)
